---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const updatedDate = '1 January 2025'; // TODO: Update when T&Cs are finalised
---

<BaseLayout
 title="Terms & Conditions"
 description="Limber terms and conditions — membership, cancellation policy, class bookings, and more."
 noindex={true}
>
 <section class="bg-limber-brown py-24 lg:py-36">
 <div class=" px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
 <p class="font-headline text-xs text-limber-vibe mb-4">Legal</p>
 <h1 class="font-headline text-5xl md:text-6xl text-limber-cream leading-tight mb-3">
 Terms &amp; Conditions
 </h1>
 <p class="font-sans text-sm text-limber-cream/60">Last updated: {updatedDate}</p>
 </div>
 </section>

 <section class="py-16 bg-limber-cream-bg">
 <div class=" px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
 <!--
 TODO: Replace all sections below with your actual Terms & Conditions.
 We recommend having a legal professional review before publishing.
 -->

 <div class="space-y-10 font-sans text-sm text-limber-brown/80 leading-relaxed">

 <div>
 <h2 class="font-headline text-base text-limber-green mb-3">1. Introduction</h2>
 <p>
 These Terms and Conditions govern your use of Limber services, including class bookings,
 memberships, and the limberco.com.au website. By purchasing a membership, class pack, or
 booking a class, you agree to these terms.
 </p>
 </div>

 <div>
 <h2 class="font-headline text-base text-limber-green mb-3">2. Bookings</h2>
 <p>
 All class bookings are made online via Momence. A booking is only confirmed once payment has
 been received and a confirmation email has been sent.
 </p>
 </div>

 <div>
 <h2 class="font-headline text-base text-limber-green mb-3">3. Cancellation Policy</h2>
 <p>
 Classes may be cancelled up to [X] hours before the scheduled start time for a full credit.
 Cancellations made within [X] hours of class start time, or failure to attend without notice,
 will result in the loss of that class credit.
 </p>
 </div>

 <div>
 <h2 class="font-headline text-base text-limber-green mb-3">4. Memberships</h2>
 <p>
 Memberships are billed [weekly/fortnightly] via direct debit. Memberships may be paused for a
 minimum of [X] weeks with [X] days notice. To cancel a membership, [X] days written notice is
 required via email to <a href="mailto:hello@limberco.com.au" class="text-limber-tericotta hover:underline">hello@limberco.com.au</a>.
 </p>
 </div>

 <div>
 <h2 class="font-headline text-base text-limber-green mb-3">5. Class Packs</h2>
 <p>
 Class packs are non-refundable. Each pack has a validity period as stated at time of purchase.
 Classes not used within the validity period will be forfeited.
 </p>
 </div>

 <div>
 <h2 class="font-headline text-base text-limber-green mb-3">6. Health &amp; Safety</h2>
 <p>
 Clients are responsible for disclosing any injuries, medical conditions, or pregnancy to their
 instructor prior to class. Limber accepts no liability for injury arising from failure to
 disclose relevant health information.
 </p>
 </div>

 <div>
 <h2 class="font-headline text-base text-limber-green mb-3">7. Liability</h2>
 <p>
 Participation in classes is at your own risk. Limber is not liable for any loss, injury,
 or damage to persons or property occurring on the premises or during classes, except where
 required by law.
 </p>
 </div>

 <div>
 <h2 class="font-headline text-base text-limber-green mb-3">8. Intro Trial</h2>
 <p>
 The intro trial offer is available to new Limber members only and may only be purchased
 once per person. Any attempt to purchase the trial more than once will result in cancellation
 of the duplicate order.
 </p>
 </div>

 <div>
 <h2 class="font-headline text-base text-limber-green mb-3">9. Changes to Terms</h2>
 <p>
 Limber reserves the right to update these Terms and Conditions at any time. Continued use
 of our services following any changes constitutes acceptance of the updated terms.
 </p>
 </div>

 <div>
 <h2 class="font-headline text-base text-limber-green mb-3">10. Contact</h2>
 <p>
 Questions about these Terms? Email us at <a href="mailto:hello@limberco.com.au" class="text-limber-tericotta hover:underline">hello@limberco.com.au</a>.
 </p>
 </div>

 </div>
 </div>
 </section>
</BaseLayout>
